---
import TopNav from '../../components/TopNav.astro';

const smallerFeatures = [
  {
    number: '05',
    title: 'Learn as you explore',
    body: 'Tutorial tips explain interactive controls on hover. Turn them off from Help when you know your way around.',
    image: 'feature-tutorial-help.png',
    imageWidth: 1108,
    imageHeight: 372,
    imageAlt: 'Help menu with Tutorial tips checked and a tooltip explaining the setting',
    link: '../guide/settings-and-formats.html',
    linkLabel: 'Tutorial tip setting',
  },
  {
    number: '06',
    title: 'Keep an eye on resources',
    body: 'The top bar shows process memory, UI time, and the selected dataset’s raw size while you work.',
    image: 'feature-process-stats.png',
    imageWidth: 1086,
    imageHeight: 344,
    imageAlt: 'H5Jive status bar showing raw data size, RAM usage, UI time, and display backend',
    link: '../guide/exploring-data.html',
    linkLabel: 'Exploring data guide',
  },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#081b2d" />
    <meta name="description" content="Explore H5Jive's file shortcuts, table editing, and geographic coverage preview." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="../h5jive-icon.png" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../site.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../layout.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../features.css" />
    <script data-goatcounter="https://h5jive.goatcounter.com/count" async src="//gc.zgo.at/count.js"></script>
    <title>Features — H5Jive</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="../" aria-label="H5Jive home"><img class="brand-icon" src="../h5jive.png" width="42" height="42" alt="" /> H5Jive</a>
      <TopNav root="../" current="features" />
    </header>

    <main class="features-page wrap">
      <section class="features-intro" aria-labelledby="features-title">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">H5JIVE / FEATURES</p><h1 id="features-title">Small details.<br /><em>Smoother exploring.</em></h1></div>
        <p>Alongside the main views, H5Jive has a few shortcuts that make everyday work with scientific files easier.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-spotlight" aria-labelledby="drop-title">
        <div class="spotlight-copy"><p class="feature-index">01 / OPEN FILES</p><h2 id="drop-title">Drop a file into A or B.</h2><p>Drag a local data file over the H5Jive window. Two targets appear: drop on the left to open it as File A, or on the right to open it as File B for comparison.</p></div>
        <figure class="feature-image"><a href="../drag-and-drop.png" aria-label="Open full-size drag and drop screenshot"><img src="../drag-and-drop.png" width="2564" height="1508" alt="H5Jive window showing two drag and drop targets labeled Drop as File A and Drop as File B, with a local file hovering over the left target" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption><span>DRAG &amp; DROP <span class="caption-divider">/</span> FILE A OR B</span><a href="../drag-and-drop.png">View full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-story" aria-labelledby="quick-file-title">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="feature-index">02 / QUICK FILE SELECTION</p><h2 id="quick-file-title">Switch files from the tree.</h2><p>Click the file name under File A or File B to open the file picker for that tab. Choose a different file without leaving the dataset tree.</p><a class="text-link" href="../guide/getting-started.html">Opening files in H5Jive <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <figure class="feature-image feature-image--compact"><a href="../feature-quick-file-select.png" aria-label="Open full-size quick file selection screenshot"><img src="../feature-quick-file-select.png" width="962" height="620" alt="File A tab in the dataset tree with its file name underlined and a tooltip explaining that clicking it opens the file picker for this tab" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption><span>DATASET TREE <span class="caption-divider">/</span> FILE PICKER</span><a href="../feature-quick-file-select.png">View full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-story" aria-labelledby="edit-values-title">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="feature-index">03 / EDIT VALUES</p><h2 id="edit-values-title">Edit, review, then apply.</h2><p>Click a numeric table cell to change it. Staged values stay highlighted while you inspect the table, and you can apply or discard the changes together.</p><a class="text-link" href="../guide/exploring-data.html">How table editing works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <figure class="feature-image"><a href="../view-data-edit.png" aria-label="Open full-size data editing screenshot"><img src="../view-data-edit.png" width="2564" height="1508" alt="H5Jive data table with highlighted pending cell edits, an active cell editor, and Discard and Apply changes buttons below the table" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption><span>DATA TABLE <span class="caption-divider">/</span> PENDING EDITS</span><a href="../view-data-edit.png">View full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-story" aria-labelledby="coverage-title">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="feature-index">04 / COVERAGE PREVIEW</p><h2 id="coverage-title">See the footprint first.</h2><p>Before exporting a spatiotemporal subset, preview the selected products as sampled points on a world map and two opposite globe hemispheres. The popup gives a quick check of geographic coverage.</p><a class="text-link" href="../plugins/spatiotemporal-subset/">Explore the subset plugin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <figure class="feature-image feature-image--portrait"><a href="../feature-coverage-preview.png" aria-label="Open full-size coverage preview screenshot"><img src="../feature-coverage-preview.png" width="1178" height="1196" alt="Coverage preview popup showing sampled orange points over a world map and two globe hemispheres with geographic grids and muted coastlines" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption><span>SUBSET EXPORT <span class="caption-divider">/</span> COVERAGE</span><a href="../feature-coverage-preview.png">View full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-collection" aria-labelledby="more-features-title">
        <div class="collection-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE IN THE WORKFLOW</p><h2 id="more-features-title">Useful touches.</h2></div><p>Settings and status cues help you stay oriented as you work.</p></div>
        <div class="collection-grid">{smallerFeatures.map((feature) => <article class="collection-card"><span>{feature.number}</span><h3>{feature.title}</h3><p>{feature.body}</p><a class="collection-thumb" href={`../${feature.image}`} aria-label={`Open full-size ${feature.title.toLowerCase()} screenshot`}><img src={`../${feature.image}`} width={feature.imageWidth} height={feature.imageHeight} alt={feature.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><a href={feature.link}>{feature.linkLabel} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer wrap"><a class="brand" href="../"><img class="brand-icon" src="../h5jive.png" width="32" height="32" alt="" /> H5Jive</a><span>Dig into your data.</span><span>© H5Jive contributors</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
